# Build artifacts
**.img
**.com
**.z[1-8]
*.o
# Header dependency files written by the compiler's -MMD (src/makefile)
*.d
*.a
*.so
*.dylib

# Executables
src/romwbw_emu
src/test_*

# WebAssembly build artifacts
web/*.js
web/*.wasm
web/*.data
web/cpm_cli
# Rendered from romwbw.html-template at build time (CI and the deploy
# targets both substitute @VERSION@); the template is the checked-in source.
web/romwbw.html

# Editor files
*~
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Assembler artifacts
*.rel
*.lst
*.map
*.hex
*.ihx

# ROM images. Since v1.40 this repository tracks NONE: they are published as
# release assets by avwohl/romwbw_disks and fetched with tools/romwbw-get,
# which caches them under $XDG_CACHE_HOME/romwbw_emu. roms/build_emu_rom.sh
# still assembles bank 0 from src/emu_hbios.asm to prove the published ROM is
# reproducible from this source, and refuses to write its output inside the
# tree - this line is the backstop for anything else that tries.
#
# Note what this does NOT do: adding a pattern here does not untrack a file
# that is already committed. The nine ROMs and two images that used to live in
# roms/, web/ and disks/ were removed with `git rm`; .github/workflows/test.yml
# asserts that none has come back.
*.rom
roms/*.bin
web/catalog/

# Local machine-specific makefile settings
src/local.mk
web/*.img

# Node.js
node_modules/
